"""The merged guidance. Source keys resolve to the preserved source entries.

Each entry can also cite decisions from a review that was imported with
import_review.py. A review example is r(item, kind, a, b, note):

    accepted   a is wording of the original, b is wording of the accepted text
    edited     a is wording of the suggestion, b is Hang's wording
               (a alone: Hang deleted it; b alone: Hang added it)
    declined   a is wording of the declined suggestion, b is the original that stayed
    kept       b is wording of the accepted text that stayed as it was
    note       no wording, only the note
    said       item is an instruction (HI-xx in sources/hang-instructions.json), a is a quotation from it
    hand       item is a hand edit (HE-xx in sources/hand-edits.json), a is from the text before, b from after

The build checks every a and b against the imported review, the instructions, or
the hand edits, after LaTeX emphasis is written as *...* and \\% as %.

Each piece of evidence carries a weight (WEIGHTS in build_reference.py). Hang's own
words and edits weigh most, then declines, then acceptances. A decision that an
assistant made under Hang's delegation, or one that was inferred, weighs nothing
and cannot be cited.

New entries go at the end of the list so that the HSR numbers of the earlier
entries stay the same. The reader files order entries by category. changed holds
what the Chapter 8 review changed (October 12, 2026), and updated what the update
from all reviews changed (October 19, 2026).
"""

ENTRIES = []


def r(item, kind, a='', b='', note=''):
    return dict(item=item, kind=kind, a=a, b=b, note=note)


def add(category, title, sources, guidance, forms, boundary, review=(), changed='', new=False,
        forms_label='Reusable forms', updated=''):
    ENTRIES.append(dict(category=category, title=title, sources=sources.split(),
                        guidance=guidance, forms=forms, boundary=boundary,
                        review=list(review), changed=changed, new=new, forms_label=forms_label,
                        updated=updated))


